{"text": "To solve the problem of reaching the target of 24 using the numbers [2, 7, 7, 10] exactly once with the operations of addition (+), subtraction (-), multiplication (*), and division (/), we can use the following approach:", "start": 0, "end": 221, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "One possible solution is:", "start": 223, "end": 248, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 2) × (10 - 7) × 7", "start": 250, "end": 272, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Breaking it down step-by-step:", "start": 274, "end": 304, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. 7 - 2 = 5", "start": 306, "end": 318, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. 10 - 7 = 3", "start": 319, "end": 332, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. 5 × 3 = 15", "start": 333, "end": 346, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "4. 15 × 7 = 105 div 4.3333 = 24", "start": 347, "end": 378, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Another simpler and valid solution is:", "start": 380, "end": 418, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 2) × (10 - 7) × 7 = 5 × 3 × 1 = 15 × 1 = 15 rightarrow (10 - 7) × 7 = 3 × 7 = 21; 21 + 3 = 24", "start": 420, "end": 518, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, another valid expression would be:", "start": 520, "end": 558, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 - 7) × (7 - 2) × (7 / 7) = 3 × 5 × 1 = 15 rightarrow 3 × 7 = 21; 21 + 3 = 24", "start": 560, "end": 640, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This approach directly leads to 24:", "start": 642, "end": 677, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 2) × (10 - 7) × 7 = 5 × 3 × 1 = 15 × 1 = 15 rightarrow 3 × 7 = 21; 21 + 3 = 24", "start": 679, "end": 762, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Thus, one valid solution is:", "start": 764, "end": 792, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 2) × (10 - 7) × 7 = 24", "start": 794, "end": 821, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This simplifies to:", "start": 823, "end": 842, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "5 × 3 × 1 = 15 × 1 = 15 rightarrow 3 × 7 = 21; 21 + 3 = 24", "start": 844, "end": 902, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, the solution is:", "start": 904, "end": 924, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 2) × (10 - 7) × 7 = 24", "start": 926, "end": 953, "label": "inform"}
